[00:00.98][Chorus: Shaboozey & Noah Cyrus]
[00:01.22]Is it my fault that you're lost?
[00:01.22]你的迷失，是否归咎于我
[00:06.75]It's hard for me to see you when you're drunk in a bathroom stall
[00:06.75]不忍目睹你在浴室烂醉如泥
[00:12.54]Takin' pills, givin' up
[00:12.54]用药品麻醉沉沦的内心
[00:16.61]You're tryna find your friends but it's too dark
[00:16.61]试图找寻同伴 四周却一片黑暗
[00:19.67]Tell me how you're gettin' home, you took the car?
[00:19.67]向我坦白 你要如何回家 是否坐上我的车
[00:26.43]Call me 'fore you passed out in the yard
[00:26.43]在你醉倒在院子里不省人事前联系我
[00:29.38]Feelin' low then high, where did everything go wrong?
[00:29.38]你情绪低落 倏忽高涨，到底是哪里出了错
[00:34.13]You say that it's the universe and blame it on the stars
[00:34.13]你说这是宇宙的安排 将责任咎于天上的星辰
[00:38.42]
[00:38.69][Verse 1: Shaboozey]
[00:40.19]Yeah
[00:40.19]Yeah
