[00:45.31]若要让我抚平过往的伤痕 我宁愿重蹈覆辙
[00:49.74]'Cause I'm gettin' better at the bar games, should've been a better man
[00:49.74]每夜在酒馆纵情声色，是否本该成为更好的人
[00:55.13]So don't you keep on tryin' to fix me, you've done everything you can
